    "ActivityPub requires a fixed URL to make entries unique. Note that this cannot be changed later without resetting the Aloha Social app." : "ActivityPub krever en fast URL for å gjøre oppføringer unike. Merk at dette ikke kan endres senere uten å tilbakestille den sosiale appen.",
